## 2. Fan operating-point equation

The pressure balance is

\[
P_0-S_0\dot V^2
=
K_{\text{loss}}\frac12\rho_a
\left(\frac{\dot V}{A_{\text{flow}}}\right)^2
\]

Therefore,

\[
\dot V
=
\sqrt{
\frac{P_0}{
S_0+
\frac{0.5\rho_aK_{\text{loss}}}{A_{\text{flow}}^2}
}}
\]

where

\[
0.5\rho_a=0.5(1.14)=0.57\ \mathrm{kg/m^3}.
\]

